## approveFormRecord (BC-4)

- **requires_approval guard**: APPROVAL_NOT_REQUIRED if template.requires_approval is false
- **Status guard**: APPROVE_INVALID_STATUS if status ≠ COMPLETE
- **SoD (BC-4)**: approver ≠ completed_by AND approver ≠ opened_by
